DERIVED DATA NOTICE
-------------------
Domain rankings are derived from the Tranco list, which is itself distributed
under CC BY 4.0 and must be cited independently:

  V. Le Pochat, T. Van Goethem, S. Tajalizadehkhoob, M. Korczynski, and
  W. Joosen, "Tranco: A Research-Oriented Top Sites Ranking Hardened Against
  Manipulation," NDSS 2019. https://tranco-list.eu/
